strictions and GM Notes. || MONEY: 1D6x100 credits stored (the text layer prints !D6xlOO); 1D6x100 credits of tradeable goods, the 500 credit monthly salary, the 10% cut of spoils and the occasional 5-10% bonus are in GM Notes. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: one weapon for each W.P.; folding shovel, bedroll, belt, boots, personal items; the vehicle (a partial bionic horse with barding, or a battered hovercycle, motorcycle or similar small vehicle, missing 1D4x10 M.D.C. from the main body, printed !D4xlO) is in GM Notes because the M.D.C. loss is rolled. The armor choice names this book''s homemade light and medium suits; any modern armor of 30-100 M.D.C. is the alternative. || CYBERNETICS: none to start. || Secret Resources, the Note line (most hated of the Reavers) and Equipment Available On Assignment are prose, in GM Notes."
